# Day 30/60 — AI Supply Chain Optimizer

## Objective

Today I built an AI-powered Supply Chain Optimizer that allows users to experiment with different operational strategies and observe how each decision affects overall business performance.

The simulator helps visualize the relationship between suppliers, manufacturing, warehousing, transportation, inventory management, and operational efficiency.

