- Warehouse Strategy Simulator
- Transportation Optimizer
- Inventory Management Simulator
- Live Business Metrics Dashboard
- Overall Supply Chain Performance Score

---

## What I Learned

### Supply Chains Involve Continuous Trade-Offs

Every operational decision impacts cost, efficiency, customer satisfaction, and long-term resilience.

### AI Enables Better Planning

Instead of relying on assumptions, AI-powered simulations make it possible to evaluate multiple strategies before implementation.

### Dashboards Improve Decision Making

Visualizing KPIs and operational metrics makes it easier to identify weaknesses and opportunities for improvement.

### Optimization Is an Ongoing Process

There is rarely one perfect solution. The best strategy depends on balancing multiple business objectives.

